      "description": "Each impeller is pushed towards suction (magenta) because its back shroud sees higher pressure than the eye side. The balance drum (green) has full discharge pressure on its inner face and near-suction pressure in the balance chamber behind it (leak-off line), creating an opposing force. A thrust bearing carries the small residual.",
